  "label": "Children are mapped as 'sea monkeys'",
  "description": "The overlaid text 'sea monkeys' is directly juxtaposed with the visual material of Black children playing in water. This creates an analogical mapping where the children are being equated with 'sea monkeys', a racist stereotype used to dehumanize them. The mapping is explicit through the text's placement over the image, forcing the viewer to associate the children with the derogatory term.",
